msgctxt "96"
msgid ""
"Take's in there. I think they've took him away. Hope we can get 'im out "
"soon..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"And they beat the crap outta Masa, too... Assholes! They think they can get "
"away with this!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "...Wait a minute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Are you the guys who were chased out of the Dragon Palace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "That's us! And we're about to go take it back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "We're more than garbage, dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"And we're done getting kicked around by these punks! Let them try and kill "
"us⑬we're taking our home back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Come on, nobody's killing anybody. You know that won't solve anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "But someone has to stand up to them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Your friend told me all about it. I'm here to get the Dragon Palace back "
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Huh? You serious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Yeah. I used to live here myself, way back when."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"And I know how you feel. They're not the first scumbags to think they own "
"this city. Just let me handle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Well, if you say so. But you gotta let us come with you! C'mon! Please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "It's going to be dangerous..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"I know, I know. But we can't rest easy until we see those punks put in "
"their place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Okay. Let's do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"People need to clean up after themselves. Look at all this trash in the "
"streets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Huh? Who the hell do you think you're talkin' to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Ugh, I know that smell... You wanna tell me what they're doing here? This "
"your fan club or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "I'm not here to talk. I'm here to beat the rules of the city into you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Shut the hell up! You got a problem with us? Bring it on, old man!"
msgstr ""

